WEBVTT

01:26.020 --> 01:31.610
[The Ingenious One]

01:33.190 --> 01:39.560
[Episode 14: An Old Enmity Lives On]

01:51.619 --> 01:53.519
Master!

01:54.660 --> 01:57.306
Master! Master!

01:57.330 --> 01:59.230
Master!

01:59.410 --> 02:00.476
Did you kill him?

02:00.500 --> 02:02.126
You couldn't do it?

02:02.150 --> 02:04.150
I'll do it for ten taels of gold.

02:04.670 --> 02:06.680
No one is allowed to touch him.

02:06.720 --> 02:08.936
I'll make him suffer a fate worse than death.

02:08.960 --> 02:11.926
He'll be like a stray dog for the rest of his life.

02:11.950 --> 02:13.406
Yun Xiang.

02:13.430 --> 02:14.256
Mr. Mo.

02:14.280 --> 02:15.566
Thank you for your help.

02:15.590 --> 02:16.430
Let's not talk about that.

02:16.430 --> 02:17.526
Come with me to see Master.

02:17.550 --> 02:18.626
It'll be hard to explain ourselves if we wait too long.

02:18.650 --> 02:20.550
Let's go.

02:53.710 --> 02:55.610
We're at the mountain gate.

02:55.670 --> 02:57.800
You should stop here.

02:59.620 --> 03:00.846
Master Wen,

03:00.870 --> 03:02.806
I’ve been cultivating in the mountain for ten years.

03:02.830 --> 03:04.476
I can't wait anymore.

03:04.500 --> 03:06.636
I'm willing to give up on being Master's personal disciple

03:06.660 --> 03:09.040
to go down the mountain with you.

03:10.450 --> 03:12.006
You've been cultivating for ten years.

03:12.030 --> 03:14.526
Why are you still so reckless?

03:14.550 --> 03:15.786
Even if I tell you,

03:15.810 --> 03:17.596
what could you do?

03:17.620 --> 03:18.456
I'm not bragging,

03:18.480 --> 03:20.740
but you may not be my match now.

03:22.310 --> 03:24.530
Yes.

03:24.730 --> 03:26.306
But in terms of wisdom,

03:26.330 --> 03:28.290
you're right.

03:29.010 --> 03:32.326
Those who are exceptionally gifted are allowed to stay in the Sect.

03:32.350 --> 03:35.120
I was chased away

03:35.140 --> 03:37.510
after less than seven years.

03:38.110 --> 03:39.886
But let me ask you,

03:39.910 --> 03:42.036
what do the members of the Yuntai Sect pride ourselves on?

03:42.060 --> 03:44.800
We build our foundations on, and make something of ourselves through wisdom.

03:45.230 --> 03:47.586
"Wisdom" can accommodate everything in the world.

03:47.610 --> 03:48.296
Of course.

03:48.320 --> 03:49.886
Okay.

03:49.910 --> 03:52.286
You have cultivated your wisdom for ten years.

03:52.310 --> 03:55.340
Why can't it accommodate the hatred in your heart?

03:59.590 --> 04:01.876
The Yuntai Sect only teaches you your craft,

04:01.900 --> 04:03.686
but how you act depends on your heart.

04:03.710 --> 04:04.806
As the saying goes,

04:04.830 --> 04:06.886
your heart should be placed before your craft.

04:06.910 --> 04:10.016
To do the opposite would be to become a heretic.

04:10.040 --> 04:11.566
Kid,

04:11.590 --> 04:13.186
let bygones be bygones.

04:13.210 --> 04:15.970
I hope you can remember this.

04:17.370 --> 04:18.866
You haven't left the mountain yet,

04:18.890 --> 04:21.470
and everything you're saying is already against the Sect's rules.

04:23.810 --> 04:25.766
What? Are you going to report me?

04:25.790 --> 04:26.676
No.

04:26.700 --> 04:28.316
Look at me. I can neither let go of my sentimentality

04:28.340 --> 04:29.746
nor my hatred.

04:29.770 --> 04:31.026
Have these ten years of cultivation

04:31.050 --> 04:33.180
been all for nothing?

04:40.230 --> 04:43.639
One day, when you begin your quest for revenge,

04:43.910 --> 04:46.460
don't forget to ask yourself

04:47.110 --> 04:50.320
whether you are sacrificing what's important for petty gain.

04:54.230 --> 04:56.036
We wouldn't have known this if we hadn't defeated the Cao Sect.

04:56.060 --> 04:58.416
Qi Tianfeng is really capable.

04:58.440 --> 05:01.526
The connections behind the Cao Sect are convoluted,

05:01.550 --> 05:03.456
but he's managed to sort them all out.

05:03.480 --> 05:05.106
If he didn't have a big appetite,

05:05.130 --> 05:06.886
the Cao Sect would still be going strong.

05:06.910 --> 05:10.700
You can't ask for more than your lot in life.

05:11.100 --> 05:12.866
He didn't know that desires beget misery,

05:12.890 --> 05:15.020
and having no wants brings strength.

05:15.290 --> 05:16.316
By the way,

05:16.340 --> 05:19.066
Qi Tianfeng said that the Lingyuan Sect is behind Tang Xiao.

05:19.090 --> 05:20.990
What do you think?

05:22.320 --> 05:24.436
Qi Tianfeng is vicious,

05:24.460 --> 05:26.166
but he's a straightforward person.

05:26.190 --> 05:27.326
If he said that,

05:27.350 --> 05:29.136
it's probably true.

05:29.160 --> 05:30.256
When did you hear that

05:30.280 --> 05:32.576
the Lingyuan Sect has also started to get involved in trade?

05:32.600 --> 05:34.525
Their foundation has always been in the martial arts.

05:34.549 --> 05:35.916
And they hate

05:35.940 --> 05:37.266
the Yuntai Sect's tactics.

05:37.290 --> 05:40.576
But if Tang Xiao has no backer,

05:40.600 --> 05:44.670
how does he dare to instigate Qi Tianfeng to provoke the Yuntai Sect?

05:48.610 --> 05:50.306
Forget it.

05:50.330 --> 05:51.646
I'll judge

05:51.670 --> 05:53.366
after I take down Tang Xiao.

05:53.390 --> 05:54.986
In other words,

05:55.010 --> 05:57.540
there's no need to report to Master for the time being.

05:59.549 --> 06:01.646
You must be afraid that if things get out of hand,

06:01.670 --> 06:02.876
Master will make other arrangements

06:02.900 --> 06:04.366
and hinder your private investigation.

06:04.390 --> 06:06.290
I'll have to trouble you, Mr. Mo.

06:06.350 --> 06:07.726
Fine.

06:07.750 --> 06:09.650
Thank you.

06:14.660 --> 06:16.006
I promised you.

06:16.030 --> 06:18.520
Why are you still pulling a long face?

06:20.300 --> 06:23.566
I have been planning my every move through my skill of induction.

06:23.590 --> 06:25.796
The moment Qi Tianfeng fell into my trap,

06:25.820 --> 06:28.656
he was destined to fail.

06:28.680 --> 06:31.500
Now that everything is settled,

06:32.320 --> 06:34.220
it seems

06:35.080 --> 06:38.170
I'm not feeling how I'd thought I would.

06:39.830 --> 06:41.310
Seeing the people around you

06:41.330 --> 06:43.256
go through all this for you

06:43.280 --> 06:45.290
has made you soft-hearted?

06:46.980 --> 06:51.656
At the end of the day, Yuntai's craft is to make use of everything.

06:51.680 --> 06:52.936
As long as the ending is good,

06:52.960 --> 06:54.286
the process is secondary.

06:54.310 --> 06:56.476
You've been cultivating the longest, so you're the most deeply entangled.

06:56.500 --> 06:57.566
It's not your fault.

06:57.590 --> 06:58.896
Don't blame yourself.

06:58.920 --> 07:01.060
Do you think I will lose everyone around me

07:02.540 --> 07:04.690
if I go on like this?

07:06.250 --> 07:08.076
You used me a lot.

07:08.100 --> 07:08.800
Why don't you

07:08.820 --> 07:11.350
feel any guilt towards me?

07:17.090 --> 07:18.616
Yun Xiang.

07:18.640 --> 07:20.990
Do you admit to your crime?

07:21.590 --> 07:23.490
I did this

07:23.540 --> 07:25.356
to follow your instructions.

07:25.380 --> 07:27.316
You're talking nonsense again.

07:27.340 --> 07:28.136
Tell me.

07:28.160 --> 07:30.816
Let’s see how you’ll explain this time.

07:30.840 --> 07:32.236
It’s easy

07:32.260 --> 07:34.710
to defeat the Su family.

07:34.970 --> 07:38.216
But it can only bring minor benefits to the Sect.

07:38.240 --> 07:40.750
What is most valuable about the Su family?

07:40.920 --> 07:42.920
It’s neither their property,

07:43.140 --> 07:45.156
nor their status as a royal silk supplier,

07:45.180 --> 07:48.676
but the good name they have earned over the past 100 years.

07:48.700 --> 07:49.956
Once their reputation is destroyed,

07:49.980 --> 07:52.986
it won't be easy to rebuild.

07:53.010 --> 07:54.646
Instead,

07:54.670 --> 07:56.976
why don't we make the Su family work for us?

07:57.000 --> 07:58.716
You think because you helped the Su family once,

07:58.740 --> 08:01.166
they will submit to you?

08:01.190 --> 08:03.176
How childish are you?

08:03.200 --> 08:05.886
If the Su family reorganizes the business world in Nandu

08:05.910 --> 08:08.946
and return peace and prosperity to this land,

08:08.970 --> 08:10.950
does the Yuntai Sect

08:11.260 --> 08:13.846
have to fixate on controlling the business world?

08:13.870 --> 08:15.816
Why don’t we cooperate with the Su family?

08:15.840 --> 08:19.476
Our interests will be secured,

08:19.500 --> 08:21.996
and we will be saved of a lot of trouble.

08:22.020 --> 08:24.606
So I thought it over,

08:24.630 --> 08:27.446
and I think right now, protecting the Su family

08:27.470 --> 08:29.736
is to protect the people of Nandu

08:29.760 --> 08:32.446
and the proper way of the Yuntai Sect.

08:32.470 --> 08:33.836
Mo Bufan.

08:33.860 --> 08:36.980
Do you agree with what Yun Xiang said?

08:40.660 --> 08:42.560
Yes.

08:43.110 --> 08:44.596
Master.

08:44.620 --> 08:46.326
Master,

08:46.350 --> 08:49.320
please don't get angry because of this.

08:49.510 --> 08:51.480
I think it's of no harm

08:52.140 --> 08:53.556
to try it his way.

08:53.580 --> 08:55.036
Mo Bufan.

08:55.060 --> 08:57.786
You've worked with Wen Cong for 20 years,

08:57.810 --> 08:59.856
but you never spoke up for him.

08:59.880 --> 09:01.646
Yun Xiang is new here,

09:01.670 --> 09:04.340
but he has already gotten your approval.

09:08.200 --> 09:08.956
Forget it.

09:08.980 --> 09:11.256
You can give it a try.

09:11.280 --> 09:14.640
Yun Xiang, watch yourself.

09:14.870 --> 09:17.790
Yes, Master.

09:19.390 --> 09:20.626
From today onwards,

09:20.650 --> 09:24.496
Yun Xiang will take over Wen Cong's charge of Nandu.

09:24.520 --> 09:27.206
Mo Bufan, you've been out in the world for many years.

09:27.230 --> 09:29.136
You're shrewd and a smooth-talker.

09:29.160 --> 09:32.626
Don't pass your bad habits on to Yun Xiang.

09:32.650 --> 09:35.350
Understood.

09:47.890 --> 09:49.566
You're the one who argued with Master,

09:49.590 --> 09:51.556
but I'm the one who got scolded.

09:51.580 --> 09:53.396
You don't understand Master's temper.

09:53.420 --> 09:55.566
He didn't scold me because he's really angry.

09:55.590 --> 09:57.346
Then you should have restrained yourself.

09:57.370 --> 09:58.496
It would have been fine if only you two were here.

09:58.520 --> 09:59.566
I was there too.

09:59.590 --> 10:01.326
You should have shown him some respect.

10:01.350 --> 10:02.826
You being there

10:02.850 --> 10:05.130
was exactly what I wanted.

10:07.260 --> 10:09.630
So you were trying to provoke Master on purpose

10:09.650 --> 10:11.166
to affect his judgment

10:11.190 --> 10:12.846
so that he wouldn't notice

10:12.870 --> 10:15.666
you had been avenging your personal grudge, right?

10:15.690 --> 10:17.326
You have a clear mind.

10:17.350 --> 10:19.486
Did you have to say it out loud?

10:19.510 --> 10:21.366
Master was right.

10:21.390 --> 10:25.850
Don't get yourself hurt.

10:27.980 --> 10:30.926
Master scolded me for no reason.

10:30.950 --> 10:33.406
I'm going to infect you

10:33.430 --> 10:35.640
with all the bad habits I have.

10:36.740 --> 10:37.686
What do you mean?

10:37.710 --> 10:38.836
Let me ask you.

10:38.860 --> 10:42.326
If you obeyed the Sect's rules in all your actions,

10:42.350 --> 10:44.986
everything you do would be flawless

10:45.010 --> 10:48.146
and everyone around you would respect and fear you.

10:48.170 --> 10:50.046
Is that what you want?

10:50.070 --> 10:51.446
to be left behind and isolated from the world.

10:51.470 --> 10:52.710
Isn't that the highest level of attainment

10:52.710 --> 10:54.376
us people of the Yuntai Sect pursue?

10:54.400 --> 10:55.686
Bah!

10:55.710 --> 10:57.956
You really want to become an immortal?

10:57.980 --> 10:59.886
Then you shouldn't have any emotions.

10:59.910 --> 11:00.896
Do I have any?

11:00.920 --> 11:02.546
If your heart were really as calm as water,

11:02.570 --> 11:03.686
I wouldn't have told you

11:03.710 --> 11:06.200
anything I just did.

11:08.700 --> 11:09.826
Alright.

11:09.850 --> 11:11.806
Lower your defenses.

11:11.830 --> 11:13.526
Aren't you tired having them up all the time?

11:13.550 --> 11:15.146
When you feel relaxed,

11:15.170 --> 11:16.846
you will find

11:16.870 --> 11:20.086
the world is not as good as you think,

11:20.110 --> 11:22.720
but it's also not as bad as you think it is.

11:30.250 --> 11:33.336
[Liansheng House]

11:32.910 --> 11:34.036
But to be honest,

11:34.060 --> 11:36.460
I was really scared.

11:36.500 --> 11:38.726
But I thought, "I cannot chicken out."

11:38.750 --> 11:40.386
I don't care about other people,

11:40.410 --> 11:42.686
but I have to take care of Shu.

11:42.710 --> 11:44.610
Here.

11:47.400 --> 11:48.846
Jin has always been loyal.

11:48.870 --> 11:49.756
What happened next?

11:49.780 --> 11:52.126
It got more interesting.

11:52.150 --> 11:54.106
Before I rushed up with a knife,

11:54.130 --> 11:55.746
Shu took two steps forward

11:55.770 --> 11:58.040
and began talking to the pirate.

11:58.450 --> 11:59.316
By the way,

11:59.340 --> 12:01.756
what does “blood debt" mean?

12:01.780 --> 12:04.016
And when did you save

12:04.040 --> 12:05.716
the Master?

12:05.740 --> 12:08.106
Blood debt is a custom of the pirates.

12:08.130 --> 12:10.906
As long as a ship encounters a disaster at sea

12:10.930 --> 12:12.276
and is rescued,

12:12.300 --> 12:15.470
the Master will owe a blood debt.

12:15.600 --> 12:16.516
No matter

12:16.540 --> 12:18.686
which ship the benefactor runs into in the future

12:18.710 --> 12:20.086
and no matter whether they are enemies or friends,

12:20.110 --> 12:21.516
they can ask for compensation.

12:21.540 --> 12:22.846
If they are refused,

12:22.870 --> 12:24.026
the Master

12:24.050 --> 12:27.090
will become the public enemy of all the pirates.

12:27.610 --> 12:31.170
You are friends with pirates?

12:32.110 --> 12:33.676
I just heard some rumors

12:33.700 --> 12:35.266
and know some names.

12:35.290 --> 12:38.640
We were desperate, so I wanted to trick Master Guan.

12:39.330 --> 12:41.320
Cheers.

12:47.870 --> 12:50.230
Here, fill me up.

12:55.510 --> 12:57.076
You...

12:57.100 --> 12:58.806
Yun Xiang led you astray.

12:58.830 --> 13:00.516
But you didn't learn the crux.

13:00.540 --> 13:01.596
Jin.

13:01.620 --> 13:03.326
What do you mean?

13:03.350 --> 13:04.926
When it comes to lying,

13:04.950 --> 13:06.960
when has Yun Xiang ever failed?

13:07.500 --> 13:10.086
Shu is different.

13:10.110 --> 13:11.446
What she said...

13:11.470 --> 13:12.230
That pirate chief

13:12.230 --> 13:14.600
didn't pay attention to her at all.

14:53.310 --> 14:54.196
Sure enough,

14:54.220 --> 14:56.666
children see everything.

14:56.690 --> 14:59.286
They can tell who is kind and who isn't

14:59.310 --> 15:00.766
from a glance.

15:00.790 --> 15:02.436
She's right.

15:02.460 --> 15:03.586
In your eyes,

15:03.610 --> 15:05.566
everyone is a pawn.

15:05.590 --> 15:07.946
You tried so hard to save Godfather,

15:07.970 --> 15:10.606
but you didn't look sad at all that he's dead.

15:10.630 --> 15:12.966
Death is final. Why beat ourselves up over it?

15:12.990 --> 15:14.926
If you obeyed the Sect's rules

15:14.950 --> 15:16.230
in all your actions,

15:16.230 --> 15:19.046
everything you do would be flawless

15:19.070 --> 15:21.986
and everyone around you would respect and fear you.

15:22.010 --> 15:23.726
Is that what you want?

15:23.750 --> 15:25.650
You are not worth

15:26.870 --> 15:28.770
my loyalty.

15:29.990 --> 15:32.240
Did I win

15:33.150 --> 15:35.050
or lose?

15:37.190 --> 15:39.090
Yes.

15:39.870 --> 15:41.770
or not.

15:50.140 --> 15:52.040
Is this

15:52.310 --> 15:54.210
farewell wine?

15:56.800 --> 15:58.700
What do you think?

16:07.710 --> 16:09.156
There are so many interesting places.

16:09.180 --> 16:10.786
Why do you have to sit here?

16:10.810 --> 16:12.710
Let's go.

16:44.680 --> 16:46.226
Rather than watching others from afar,

16:46.250 --> 16:49.450
it's better to join them.

17:02.370 --> 17:03.886
Do you get drunk easily?

17:03.910 --> 17:05.839
What do you mean?

17:07.190 --> 17:10.040
I envy those who get drunk easily.

17:10.790 --> 17:12.725
Everyone is drunk, but you alone are sober.

17:12.749 --> 17:14.649
Isn't it tiring?

17:15.070 --> 17:18.240
Why didn't you go in when you saw us?

17:18.630 --> 17:20.870
I didn't want to disturb you.

17:23.009 --> 17:24.930
What happened today?

17:25.110 --> 17:27.360
I know you've gotten your revenge.

17:27.390 --> 17:31.050
Tell me when you're leaving.

17:31.440 --> 17:33.450
Don't stay silent.

17:37.270 --> 17:38.526
What?

17:38.550 --> 17:40.086
Do I have to create an uproar

17:40.110 --> 17:42.010
to celebrate?

17:42.390 --> 17:44.290
Celebrate what?

17:44.870 --> 17:46.110
To celebrate leaving those disputes

17:46.110 --> 17:48.280
or to celebrate leaving me?

17:51.070 --> 17:52.876
Sounds good.

17:52.900 --> 17:54.326
Let me think about it.

17:54.350 --> 17:56.250
Okay.

18:13.220 --> 18:15.550
You really want me to leave?

18:28.350 --> 18:32.606
If I say I will change,

18:32.630 --> 18:34.530
will you believe me?

18:35.310 --> 18:38.560
Change what? How?

18:40.350 --> 18:42.670
Mr. Wen told me

18:43.230 --> 18:45.940
that if I begin my quest for revenge one day,

18:46.020 --> 18:48.480
to not mistake what's important for what's trivial.

18:49.070 --> 18:51.126
I was fixated on revenge

18:51.150 --> 18:54.120
and I never cared about the people around me.

18:54.920 --> 18:56.326
I thought bringing Qi Tianfeng to justice

18:56.350 --> 18:58.880
would make me happy.

18:59.400 --> 19:01.980
But it turns out

19:02.030 --> 19:03.926
I feel empty inside.

19:03.950 --> 19:06.390
I'm afraid if this goes on,

19:07.430 --> 19:09.560
I will lose everyone around me.

19:13.350 --> 19:15.736
How can you see the people around you?

19:15.760 --> 19:18.250
They are all pawns.

19:21.390 --> 19:23.950
Have you ever seen a chess player's heart hurt

19:24.830 --> 19:27.460
when he's about to sacrifice a pawn?

19:34.160 --> 19:36.160
I want to live in another way.

19:40.670 --> 19:42.566
Waiter.

19:42.590 --> 19:45.260
Another jar of apricot blossom wine.

20:54.850 --> 20:58.206
I can drink two more jars.

20:58.230 --> 21:00.840
Why are we going back?

21:01.300 --> 21:02.606
When I'm not around,

21:02.630 --> 21:04.426
don't drink alone.

21:04.450 --> 21:05.716
I thought you were a good drinker.

21:05.740 --> 21:07.700
I feel great.

21:08.110 --> 21:10.120
Let me ask you.

21:10.190 --> 21:14.166
The next step is to deal with Tang Xiao.

21:14.190 --> 21:16.090
Yes.

21:16.190 --> 21:18.380
Do you have an idea?

21:19.030 --> 21:20.930
Yes.

21:23.620 --> 21:26.370
So fast?

21:26.830 --> 21:29.716
As expected of my Young Master Xiang,

21:29.740 --> 21:31.910
how brilliant.

21:32.670 --> 21:34.900
You must really be drunk.

21:36.230 --> 21:40.086
No, I'm not leaving.

21:40.110 --> 21:42.676
I'll stay and help you.

21:42.700 --> 21:44.780
I'll stay forever.

21:45.460 --> 21:47.700
Stop talking nonsense.

21:48.190 --> 21:50.336
Say it again tomorrow after you've thought it through.

21:50.360 --> 21:52.730
It'll be the same thing tomorrow.

21:54.210 --> 21:56.966
We agreed to take revenge together.

21:56.990 --> 21:58.696
I got my revenge.

21:58.720 --> 22:00.950
But you haven't.

22:03.550 --> 22:07.970
This time, I'll stay and keep an eye on you.

22:09.260 --> 22:11.160
Keep an eye on me?

22:11.770 --> 22:15.346
To see if you have changed,

22:15.370 --> 22:18.740
if you've learned how to treat others.

22:21.180 --> 22:23.390
Thank you for not abandoning me.

22:29.400 --> 22:31.546
Did you really lie to Master Guan?

22:31.570 --> 22:34.170
I learned it from you.

22:34.730 --> 22:36.566
Weren't you afraid the Heavens would punish you

22:36.590 --> 22:39.120
for lying about a blood debt?

22:39.400 --> 22:42.186
♫ Yumen mountains stack together ♫

22:40.430 --> 22:42.886
I'm not a good person.

22:42.210 --> 22:45.920
♫ Beacon towers spread all over the mountains ♫

22:42.910 --> 22:45.480
It would have punished me long ago if it wanted to.

22:46.070 --> 22:48.980
♫ People depended on beacon fires on the frontier ♫

22:49.000 --> 22:52.246
♫ Horses disappeared into the mountains ♫

22:52.270 --> 22:58.720
♫ Spring and rain are in our hearts ♫

23:00.800 --> 23:04.176
♫ Locking two doors to our hearts ♫

23:04.200 --> 23:07.476
♫ More wrinkles appear on my forehead ♫

23:07.500 --> 23:10.856
♫ I was so anxious ♫

23:10.880 --> 23:14.196
♫ I feared the wind would blow away my fate ♫

23:14.220 --> 23:17.556
♫ People come and go ♫

23:17.580 --> 23:20.916
♫ Turning around once in a lifetime ♫

23:20.940 --> 23:23.806
♫ From now on, the door to my heart ♫

23:23.830 --> 23:28.600
♫ Will not entertain anyone else ♫

23:37.020 --> 23:40.140
[Liansheng House]

24:04.220 --> 24:06.120
Are you awake?

24:08.030 --> 24:09.796
My head hurts.

24:09.820 --> 24:11.900
How did we come back?

24:11.940 --> 24:13.840
You don't remember?

24:32.000 --> 24:33.900
I only remember some things.

24:37.290 --> 24:39.190
Which?

24:41.090 --> 24:42.726
You said you wanted to turn over a new leaf

24:42.750 --> 24:45.120
and be sincere to the people around you.

24:46.680 --> 24:48.580
What else?

24:53.510 --> 24:55.410
You...

24:57.430 --> 25:02.150
want me to supervise you to keep your promise.

25:07.380 --> 25:09.700
What? Did I say something else?

25:09.870 --> 25:11.770
No, that's all.

25:22.280 --> 25:23.846
Let's get down to business.

25:23.870 --> 25:24.766
I've figured out a way

25:24.790 --> 25:26.426
to deal with Tang Xiao.

25:26.450 --> 25:27.526
But this time,

25:27.550 --> 25:29.860
I'll need everyone's cooperation.

25:30.180 --> 25:31.176
Also,

25:31.200 --> 25:32.866
in the future,

25:32.890 --> 25:33.426
if I do something

25:33.450 --> 25:35.676
to hurts others' feelings,

25:35.700 --> 25:37.166
just point it out.

25:37.190 --> 25:39.090
I'll listen to you.

25:42.430 --> 25:44.330
Let’s go.

25:47.350 --> 25:49.436
Are you serious?

25:49.460 --> 25:50.390
Actually, Su Mingyu and I

25:50.390 --> 25:51.836
have already discussed it.

25:51.860 --> 25:53.856
When Liansheng House reopens,

25:53.880 --> 25:55.066
you will no longer be the head dealer,

25:55.090 --> 25:56.990
but the manager.

25:57.150 --> 26:00.926
But there has never been a precedent in Nandu

26:00.950 --> 26:02.676
of a head dealer being promoted to manager.

26:02.700 --> 26:04.206
So what?

26:04.230 --> 26:05.566
I've heard from Tianhu that

26:05.590 --> 26:08.646
even Chairman Su praises you for your talent at doing business.

26:08.670 --> 26:10.666
Who in Liansheng House

26:10.690 --> 26:12.866
is more capable than you?

26:12.890 --> 26:15.026
Although they've bought Liansheng House,

26:15.050 --> 26:18.046
Mr. Su knows nothing about gambling,

26:18.070 --> 26:20.140
and Mr. Yun...

26:21.760 --> 26:24.010
wouldn't care about it.

26:24.310 --> 26:26.866
Without your meticulous management,

26:26.890 --> 26:29.466
I'm afraid we'll lose Liansheng House to someone else

26:29.490 --> 26:31.436
in no time.

26:31.460 --> 26:35.846
But I'm of debased status, so I can only work in debased occupations.

26:35.870 --> 26:37.256
I’m afraid

26:37.280 --> 26:39.910
this is against the imperial law.

26:40.730 --> 26:43.126
Liansheng House is my property.

26:43.150 --> 26:45.276
Whether it's a manager or a head dealer,

26:45.300 --> 26:46.836
it's just a post.

26:46.860 --> 26:48.026
There's no such thing as nobility or debasement.

26:48.050 --> 26:49.950
Don't worry.

26:53.270 --> 26:56.940
But I really don't want to transgress.

26:57.390 --> 26:58.606
Don't worry.

26:58.630 --> 26:59.846
You will definitely

26:59.870 --> 27:02.680
be able to handle being the manager.

27:08.230 --> 27:10.240
This is a heavy responsibility.

27:11.110 --> 27:13.886
I won't let you down.

27:13.910 --> 27:15.810
Okay.

27:16.670 --> 27:18.566
Do you know

27:18.590 --> 27:20.086
who you have to thank

27:20.110 --> 27:22.010
for this?

27:22.510 --> 27:24.500
I am slow-witted.

27:24.550 --> 27:26.916
Please enlighten me.

27:26.940 --> 27:29.696
You should thank yourself.

27:29.720 --> 27:31.686
Although you were of debased status,

27:31.710 --> 27:33.666
you have never acted in a debased manner

27:33.690 --> 27:35.760
nor belittled yourself.

27:37.100 --> 27:39.366
You should also thank Mr. Su.

27:39.390 --> 27:41.926
Su Mingyu often told us

27:41.950 --> 27:44.626
about how even though your background was humble,

27:44.650 --> 27:48.166
you act with more dignity and righteousness than many others.

27:48.190 --> 27:51.296
After interacting with you for a while, I found that

27:51.320 --> 27:54.086
even though Su Mingyu is naive,

27:54.110 --> 27:56.240
he is a good judge of character.

28:00.650 --> 28:02.680
Alright.

28:04.390 --> 28:08.010
Thank you, Master and Shu.

28:09.270 --> 28:10.236
Manager Ke,

28:10.260 --> 28:11.546
I need you

28:11.570 --> 28:13.066
to help me with something.

28:13.090 --> 28:15.726
Please redecorate the hall within three days.

28:15.750 --> 28:17.670
Bring these wooden furniture to be refreshed

28:17.670 --> 28:19.006
and then put them back.

28:19.030 --> 28:19.846
Also,

28:19.870 --> 28:21.796
all the paintings, ornaments, and gambling tools

28:21.820 --> 28:23.270
must be replaced with ones one level more sophisticated

28:23.270 --> 28:25.936
than those the Tang family used.

28:25.960 --> 28:27.566
Spread the news to the whole city

28:27.590 --> 28:29.366
that Liansheng House is the most high end gambling house

28:29.390 --> 28:32.676
in the whole of Nandu, and even Jiangnan.

28:32.700 --> 28:35.146
Your management style used to be modest and reliable.

28:35.170 --> 28:37.886
Why the sudden change?

28:37.910 --> 28:38.910
Don't ask.

28:38.910 --> 28:40.820
Just do it.

28:43.150 --> 28:44.926
Things have changed.

28:44.950 --> 28:46.766
I have my reasons for doing this.

28:46.790 --> 28:49.200
It's better to explain after it's all done.

28:50.670 --> 28:54.400
I’ll explain it all to you in the future.

28:54.910 --> 28:56.696
Okay.

28:56.720 --> 28:59.566
You must finish decorating within three days.

28:59.590 --> 29:00.430
In the past,

29:00.430 --> 29:02.866
even if Master wanted to demolish Liansheng House and rebuild it,

29:02.890 --> 29:05.080
I would have obeyed.

29:05.750 --> 29:08.776
But now, as the manager,

29:08.800 --> 29:11.190
I must give you some advice.

29:21.070 --> 29:21.836
Anything else?

29:21.860 --> 29:23.760
That’s it.

29:26.870 --> 29:29.366
You thought you could just change out the furniture,

29:29.390 --> 29:32.066
but you didn't know that on such a scale,

29:32.090 --> 29:34.960
it would change our manpower needs.

29:35.350 --> 29:38.276
A servant is enough for a low-stakes gambling table.

29:38.300 --> 29:40.006
If we change them out for high-stakes gambling tables,

29:40.030 --> 29:43.236
we would need a head dealer watching over each table.

29:43.260 --> 29:45.906
A head dealer costs multiple times of what a servant does.

29:45.930 --> 29:48.600
We would also have to improve our service.

29:48.660 --> 29:51.476
If we improve the quality of our food and drinks,

29:51.500 --> 29:54.616
we would need to replace our chefs.

29:54.640 --> 29:56.806
Then, there are also the musicians.

29:56.830 --> 29:58.636
Manager Ke,

29:58.660 --> 30:00.446
maybe I didn't make myself clear.

30:00.470 --> 30:02.466
We're not operating at such a level permanently.

30:02.490 --> 30:03.886
Just half a month is enough.

30:03.910 --> 30:04.846
Half a month?

30:04.870 --> 30:05.830
What happens after that?

30:05.830 --> 30:08.036
Everything will return to normal after half a month.

30:08.060 --> 30:10.440
Then why are you doing this?

30:10.910 --> 30:14.110
You will explain it to us afterwards.

30:15.830 --> 30:17.730
Yes.

30:17.950 --> 30:20.050
That won't do.

30:20.150 --> 30:23.386
The way of business is consistency.

30:23.410 --> 30:25.526
It is difficult to go from extravagance to frugality.

30:25.550 --> 30:26.876
Besides, it is inappropriate

30:26.900 --> 30:29.920
to make the gambling house upscale and then change it back.

30:30.220 --> 30:34.230
Moreover, Liansheng House was already in trouble before it closed.

30:34.720 --> 30:37.256
It’s really inappropriate to do this.

30:37.280 --> 30:38.326
Master,

30:38.350 --> 30:40.566
I don’t mean to disobey you.

30:40.590 --> 30:42.276
But...

30:42.300 --> 30:44.200
I understand.

30:45.150 --> 30:48.650
As a manager, you have the responsibility to advise your master.

30:50.350 --> 30:51.766
Be frank.

30:51.790 --> 30:53.800
How much money do you need?

30:54.670 --> 30:57.466
At least 2,500 taels.

30:57.490 --> 30:59.390
That much?

31:01.350 --> 31:04.256
After comparing prices from different stores,

31:04.280 --> 31:05.806
1,000 taels is enough to purchase the items.

31:05.830 --> 31:07.766
If we want to put together a crew,

31:07.790 --> 31:11.000
we need to pay them three months' salary as a deposit.

31:11.600 --> 31:13.116
Can we pay them monthly

31:13.140 --> 31:15.600
and make up for it when we turn a profit?

31:15.750 --> 31:17.650
It's okay.

31:17.890 --> 31:19.790
Manager Ke.

31:20.020 --> 31:21.316
I'll have to trouble you

31:21.340 --> 31:23.366
to get everything ready as soon as possible.

31:23.390 --> 31:24.046
Remember.

31:24.070 --> 31:26.070
Within three days, you must get the news out that

31:26.070 --> 31:29.280
Liansheng House is far superior to the Tangs' Gambling House.

31:29.530 --> 31:31.206
As for the money,

31:31.230 --> 31:34.790
I will raise it all by today.

31:45.110 --> 31:47.726
Upgrading Liansheng House is just like destroying Yufeng Warehouse.

31:47.750 --> 31:49.920
It's a trick, right?

31:51.320 --> 31:52.586
I destroyed one and am building the other one up.

31:52.610 --> 31:54.580
Haven't I improved?

31:55.380 --> 31:56.706
But 2,500 taels

31:56.730 --> 31:58.476
is not a small amount.

31:58.500 --> 32:00.396
Where are you going to get that money?

32:00.420 --> 32:02.440
Guanghui Bank?

32:02.590 --> 32:04.646
Guanghui Bank just took over the Cao Sect.

32:04.670 --> 32:05.826
They are still processing the silver.

32:05.850 --> 32:07.886
I don't think we can borrow any.

32:07.910 --> 32:09.810
What should we do?

32:13.080 --> 32:14.456
You were drunk last night.

32:14.480 --> 32:15.886
You must be very sick now.

32:15.910 --> 32:17.350
Do you want to go to the kitchen and have some hot soup

32:17.350 --> 32:19.250
to warm up your stomach?

32:19.590 --> 32:22.630
Okay. I'm actually not feeling well.

32:34.440 --> 32:36.340
Come in.

32:39.950 --> 32:41.850
Jin.

32:43.590 --> 32:45.490
You're sleeping?

32:46.990 --> 32:49.530
What do you want? Just tell me.

32:49.950 --> 32:51.846
Liansheng will open for business soon.

32:51.870 --> 32:54.326
I have an interesting idea.

32:54.350 --> 32:56.086
It's different from before.

32:56.110 --> 32:57.586
If we expand on it,

32:57.610 --> 32:59.860
it will be very interesting.

33:04.110 --> 33:07.200
How is it different? Tell me.

33:07.490 --> 33:10.596
How about you give it a try?

33:10.620 --> 33:13.850
It's just that no one is betting with me right now,

33:14.060 --> 33:17.140
so I can't perfect the rules.

33:17.390 --> 33:20.360
I thought long and hard about this.

33:21.030 --> 33:23.426
Only your gambling skills

33:23.450 --> 33:25.940
can compete with mine.

33:26.350 --> 33:27.796
Let's go and have a try.

33:27.820 --> 33:29.006
Jin.

33:29.030 --> 33:30.816
Since it's a new trick,

33:30.840 --> 33:32.046
we'll need real gold and silver

33:32.070 --> 33:34.046
to find the flaws.

33:34.070 --> 33:35.086
But don't worry.

33:35.110 --> 33:36.536
We'll be playing it safe.

33:36.560 --> 33:37.436
We won't go overboard.

33:37.460 --> 33:38.296
Nonsense.

33:38.320 --> 33:39.366
How can we play it safe?

33:39.390 --> 33:41.290
Let's go big.

33:42.350 --> 33:44.250
Sure.

33:44.400 --> 33:45.246
Let's go.

33:45.270 --> 33:46.646
Ten Taels of Gold.

33:46.670 --> 33:48.910
You really don't learn.

33:55.750 --> 33:58.056
Didn't you go to have soup?

33:58.080 --> 33:59.926
You never change.

33:59.950 --> 34:02.236
We agreed to treat each other with sincerity.

34:02.260 --> 34:03.266
Hang on.

34:03.290 --> 34:05.606
Didn't I treat Manager Ke with sincerity?

34:05.630 --> 34:06.670
I have to go step by step

34:06.670 --> 34:07.596
and take my time.

34:07.620 --> 34:09.186
You asked me to remind you,

34:09.210 --> 34:11.330
but you're going back on your word.

34:11.540 --> 34:13.396
Girl.

34:13.420 --> 34:15.659
If you hadn't come,

34:15.790 --> 34:17.286
would my hard-earned money

34:17.310 --> 34:19.679
have been swindled away by him?

34:23.120 --> 34:25.639
You're shaking your head.

34:26.069 --> 34:28.590
Jin, it's not true.

34:29.589 --> 34:31.576
Just tell me if you need money.

34:31.600 --> 34:34.199
Why are you beating around the bush?

34:34.510 --> 34:35.946
Yes.

34:35.970 --> 34:38.996
I do need some silver.

34:39.020 --> 34:40.795
Please help me.

34:40.819 --> 34:42.876
No problem.

34:42.900 --> 34:45.726
We're brothers. Borrowing money isn't a big deal.

34:45.750 --> 34:48.105
Come on, pay me back ten times.

34:48.129 --> 34:50.409
Write me an IOU.

34:52.350 --> 34:53.496
You're taking advantage of me.

34:53.520 --> 34:55.570
You just met me today?

34:59.860 --> 35:00.966
Master.

35:00.990 --> 35:02.606
Mr. Kang of Guanghui Bank is here.

35:02.630 --> 35:04.840
He also brought a little girl,

35:04.990 --> 35:07.500
saying she got lost in Jishan Hall.

35:13.470 --> 35:15.556
Ling'er, come after me.

35:15.580 --> 35:17.480
Give it to me.

35:20.030 --> 35:21.786
Thank you, Mr. Kang.

35:21.810 --> 35:24.416
This is the best news I've heard of late.

35:24.440 --> 35:27.180
I promised you, there's no need to thank me.

35:29.190 --> 35:31.206
Give it to me.

35:31.230 --> 35:32.746
Come after me.

35:32.770 --> 35:35.006
Give me the windmill.

35:35.030 --> 35:36.930
No.

35:37.520 --> 35:38.766
Come on.

35:38.790 --> 35:40.690
Yu.

35:41.350 --> 35:42.646
Uncle Jin.

35:42.670 --> 35:44.256
Uncle Jin, this is Ling'er.

35:44.280 --> 35:46.740
She's my best friend.

35:50.110 --> 35:52.010
Be good, Ling'er.

35:52.040 --> 35:53.166
Let me hug you.

35:53.190 --> 35:55.090
No!

35:57.350 --> 36:00.240
Ling'er is amazing.

36:01.510 --> 36:02.526
I'm sorry.

36:02.550 --> 36:03.846
This is for you.

36:03.870 --> 36:05.770
Sure.

36:16.610 --> 36:18.510
Mr. Kang.

36:18.790 --> 36:20.006
Mr. Yun.

36:20.030 --> 36:21.076
Thank you.

36:21.100 --> 36:22.236
Are you feeling better?

36:22.260 --> 36:23.346
Much better.

36:23.370 --> 36:25.370
Thank you for your concern.

36:27.090 --> 36:29.370
Any news about the other children?

36:29.790 --> 36:31.376
It's a bit complicated.

36:31.400 --> 36:34.526
Those children have either been sold to the black market as slave labor

36:34.550 --> 36:36.866
or to the rich and noble to be groomed.

36:36.890 --> 36:39.780
There are still some we can't find.

36:41.820 --> 36:43.126
Why not?

36:43.150 --> 36:44.606
No clues at all?

36:44.630 --> 36:46.406
Since Mr. Mo has an agreement with you,

36:46.430 --> 36:48.546
I will do my best to investigate.

36:48.570 --> 36:51.026
But you should know very well

36:51.050 --> 36:53.046
that once the children go to those places,

36:53.070 --> 36:55.130
they might not still be alive.

36:55.950 --> 36:57.436
I won't disturb you any longer.

36:57.460 --> 36:59.156
I'll come and report to you if there's any news.

36:59.180 --> 37:01.080
Goodbye.

37:04.870 --> 37:07.686
Did you ask the people from Guanghui Bank to help?

37:07.710 --> 37:09.096
Jin,

37:09.120 --> 37:10.756
don't worry too much.

37:10.780 --> 37:12.186
It's just that we can't find them yet.

37:12.210 --> 37:14.446
Guanghui Bank is well-connected in Nandu.

37:14.470 --> 37:17.400
With their help, it's definitely possible.

37:17.710 --> 37:19.136
Take the money.

37:19.160 --> 37:20.266
30% interest.

37:20.290 --> 37:22.190
I can't go any lower.

37:29.350 --> 37:30.266
Look.

37:30.290 --> 37:32.326
You're reaping what you've sowed.

37:32.350 --> 37:33.276
You

37:33.300 --> 37:35.910
should do good deeds more often.

37:45.990 --> 37:47.890
Young man!

37:50.380 --> 37:52.526
The longer we wait, the more dangerous it is for the children.

37:52.550 --> 37:55.080
Is there anything I can help with?

37:56.100 --> 37:58.686
Indeed, a little girl was sold as a servant.

37:58.710 --> 38:00.406
But the rich merchant didn't allow me to redeem her.

38:00.430 --> 38:02.806
He's an old customer of Guanghui Bank.

38:02.830 --> 38:03.496
I see.

38:03.520 --> 38:04.566
Which bastard is he?

38:04.590 --> 38:06.630
Leave him to me.

38:08.230 --> 38:10.136
So...

38:10.160 --> 38:11.606
someone took away

38:11.630 --> 38:14.146
the document of Miss Ke's debased status from the Music Office.

38:14.170 --> 38:16.026
I was wondering

38:16.050 --> 38:18.046
if it was the Young Master

38:18.070 --> 38:20.230
who made that happen.

38:20.350 --> 38:22.486
If he were that capable,

38:22.510 --> 38:25.400
he would have married Miss Ke long ago.

38:29.470 --> 38:31.206
I'll ask around

38:31.230 --> 38:34.206
and figure this out.

38:34.230 --> 38:37.396
Don't tell Mingyu about this today.

38:37.420 --> 38:41.420
I have something important to entrust to him today.

38:44.950 --> 38:47.770
Master, have some water.

38:53.500 --> 38:54.956
Your breathing

38:54.980 --> 38:57.300
has stabilized quite a bit.

38:59.580 --> 39:04.120
What I'm worried about now is the whole Cao Sect.

39:06.350 --> 39:07.326
Master,

39:07.350 --> 39:09.326
it doesn't matter if you have lost your martial arts skills.

39:09.350 --> 39:11.246
You used to protect us.

39:11.270 --> 39:13.126
We'll protect you from now on.

39:13.150 --> 39:14.286
Okay.

39:14.310 --> 39:16.186
We have gathered some money

39:16.210 --> 39:17.526
for the travel expenses.

39:17.550 --> 39:19.870
There are more than ten of our men outside.

39:19.910 --> 39:22.450
You can make a comeback.

39:22.870 --> 39:25.196
I’ve thought about it.

39:25.220 --> 39:28.246
Nandu is not a place for us to stay for long.

39:28.270 --> 39:29.456
How about this?

39:29.480 --> 39:32.906
Would the men be willing to travel upriver

39:32.930 --> 39:34.830
to Ba Shu?

39:35.350 --> 39:37.276
Sure.

39:37.300 --> 39:39.046
The water network in Ba Shu is dense

39:39.070 --> 39:40.726
and requires lesser labor than Jiangnan.

39:40.750 --> 39:42.026
In less than three to five years,

39:42.050 --> 39:43.126
we can build ourselves back up.

39:43.150 --> 39:45.050
Who asked you to come?

39:45.710 --> 39:47.610
Who is it?

39:48.270 --> 39:50.170
Yufeng Warehouse

39:50.790 --> 39:51.816
was burned by Miss Shu?

39:51.840 --> 39:53.930
Most likely.

39:54.110 --> 39:55.416
But if that's true,

39:55.440 --> 39:56.966
it would also have been Young Master Xiang's order.

39:56.990 --> 39:58.326
Why did Yun Xiang do that?

39:58.350 --> 40:00.366
He caused such a big stir,

40:00.390 --> 40:02.156
but the Su family benefited in the end.

40:02.180 --> 40:03.606
You are wrong.

40:03.630 --> 40:06.520
Mo Bufan was the biggest winner.

40:17.620 --> 40:18.866
Master Guan.

40:18.890 --> 40:20.326
What are you doing?

40:20.350 --> 40:21.096
Take him out.

40:21.120 --> 40:21.926
- Yes.
- Yes.

40:21.950 --> 40:22.620
Let him go!

40:22.620 --> 40:22.990
Go!

40:22.990 --> 40:25.166
Don't hurt Master!

40:25.190 --> 40:27.166
We have no grudge against you.

40:27.190 --> 40:29.286
Why must you kill us all?

40:29.310 --> 40:31.326
How can there be no grudge?

40:31.350 --> 40:33.846
I betrayed you.

40:33.870 --> 40:35.926
You're a man who always takes revenge.

40:35.950 --> 40:38.166
If you make a comeback,

40:38.190 --> 40:39.726
I'd be in trouble.

40:39.750 --> 40:41.326
If you're worried about me,

40:41.350 --> 40:42.696
you can kill me right now.

40:42.720 --> 40:44.970
But spare my men!

40:48.570 --> 40:50.296
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

40:50.320 --> 40:52.280
It's too late.

40:52.350 --> 40:54.250
You...

41:14.550 --> 41:16.156
Forget it.

41:16.180 --> 41:18.346
You're all alone, and a cripple.

41:18.370 --> 41:20.166
You can't cause any trouble.

41:20.190 --> 41:22.190
I'll spare your life.

41:31.310 --> 41:32.446
Let's go!

41:32.470 --> 41:35.000
Let's drink and eat meat!

41:44.090 --> 41:46.646
I don't know how to treat Yun Xiang now.

41:46.670 --> 41:50.286
That's exactly what I wanted to tell you.

41:50.310 --> 41:52.166
Don't distance yourself from him,

41:52.190 --> 41:54.716
and take advantage of your old friendship

41:54.740 --> 41:56.766
to get closer to him.

41:56.790 --> 41:58.860
But why?

41:59.450 --> 42:01.286
I treated him as a friend,

42:01.310 --> 42:03.370
but he used me.

42:04.060 --> 42:05.960
Mingyu.

42:06.150 --> 42:09.806
Although Yun Xiang used the Su family's power,

42:09.830 --> 42:13.166
he never put us at risk.

42:13.190 --> 42:14.266
In my opinion,

42:14.290 --> 42:16.780
he's not our enemy.

42:16.830 --> 42:20.636
You want me to get close to him

42:20.660 --> 42:22.720
to see what he'll do next?

42:23.230 --> 42:25.130
No.

42:25.340 --> 42:26.310
You can't

42:26.310 --> 42:28.286
scheme against such a smart person.

42:28.310 --> 42:30.210
So,

42:32.470 --> 42:34.486
you should treat him with sincerity

42:34.510 --> 42:36.156
as you always have.

42:36.180 --> 42:41.240
Only in this way can the Su family be safe.

43:24.990 --> 43:26.890
Gui!

43:42.830 --> 43:44.880
Brothers!

43:46.100 --> 43:49.220
Is there anyone alive?
